# Inputs for requirements-etebase-build.txt. See that file for the full command.
#
# The macOS arm64 release build compiles etebase from the pinned etebase-py commit
# c5afd1a546b8f030d1b97bcecfc5e8bf9799827b, because PyPI etebase 0.31.5 has no
# wheel for that platform. These are that commit's build-system requirements.
# They are installed only into a throwaway virtualenv that builds the etebase
# wheel with --no-build-isolation, never into the environment PyInstaller
# bundles, so the bridge binary keeps the runner's own setuptools.
setuptools
wheel
setuptools-rust
